++ less (lth 1 2)
++ greater (lth 2 1)
++ equal (lth 1 1)
++ gte-less (gte 1 2)
++ gte-greater (gte 2 1)
++ gte-equal (gte 1 1)
++ lte-less (lte 1 2)
++ lte-greater (lte 2 1)
++ lte-equal (lte 1 1)
